# Implementation Plan - MediSync Styled Auth (Separate Pages)

The objective is to implement a dual-panel card layout for Login and Register as standalone pages. This design replaces the sliding overlay with a fixed, high-contrast container inspired by the user's provided snippet.

## Proposed Changes

### [Layout & Navigation]
#### [MODIFY] [Navbar.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/ui/Navbar.tsx)
- Refine to match a cleaner, more traditional "Product" aesthetic rather than purely neumorphic.
- Standard glassmorphism with high-contrast labels.

### [Auth Refactor]
#### [MODIFY] [AuthCard.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthCard.tsx)
- **Container Structure**: Implement the `login-container` with two halves:
    - **Control/Form Half (Left)**: Minimalist inputs, high-contrast text, primary action button.
    - **Info/Branding Half (Right)**: Decorative text, secondary links.
- **Styling**: Use a "lighter" card background (higher value dark or clean light) to ensure impeccable readability.
- **Next.js Integration**: Adapt the user's `react-router-dom` snippet to Next.js (`useRouter`, [Link](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/ui/Navbar.tsx#32-43)).

#### [MODIFY] [login/page.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/login/page.tsx)
- Use the centered, dual-panel [LoginForm](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthCard.tsx#20-92).

#### [MODIFY] [register/page.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/app/register/page.tsx)
- Adapt the same dual-panel layout for the [RegisterForm](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthCard.tsx#93-168).

#### [DELETE] [AuthContainer.tsx](file:///Users/santiagovalencia/proyecto%20informatico_1%20frontend/Proyecto_Informatico/src/components/auth/AuthContainer.tsx)
- Remove as the sliding logic is no longer desired.

## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
- **Visual Balance**: Ensure the card is perfectly centered and both panels have equal visual weight.
- **Contrast Check**: Verify that text is easily readable on the "lighter" card background.
- **Responsiveness**: Check that the dual-panel collapses gracefully to a single panel on mobile.
